stages.sampleAnswer:
POST /posts
  body: { content, attachments?, idempotencyKey }
  → 201 { postId, timestamp }

GET /feed?cursor=...&limit=20
  → 200 { posts: [Post], nextCursor }

POST /posts/:id/like
  body: { idempotencyKey }
  → 201 {}

POST /posts/:id/comments
  body: { text, idempotencyKey }
  → 201 { commentId }
